DESCRIPTION                   = "This table contains mineral abundances and
 analytical errors derived from diffraction-all K-alpha diffraction data for
 the Kings Canyon drill sample, analyzed in CheMin cell number 2b (Kapton
 window). The analysis is based on RDA file 
 CMB_776288153RDA42661080792CH00113P1. Mineral identifications, abundances
 and analytical errors for crystalline phases were determined using the
 program JADE. The Fe-Mg-Ca carbonate abundance was estimated by fitting
 both ankerite and dolomite to the pattern, without refining their cell
 parameters. In addition to these crystalline phases, high intensity in
 the low 2-theta region and a broad amorphous hump were modeled using
 FULLPAT to indicate that ~58 +/- 24 weight% of the total sample consists of
 X-ray amorphous materials. All errors cited are 2-sigma. Column 1 of the
 table lists mineral identifications, column 2 lists the mineral abundances
 in weight percent, and column 3 indicates the estimated analytical errors."
END_OBJECT                    = SPREADSHEET
END

